# Schema Designer V2 - Modern Form Builder

A modern, intuitive schema designer inspired by SurveyMonkey, JotForm, and Typeform.

## Key Features

### 🎨 Beautiful, Modern UI

- Clean, uncluttered interface
- Smooth animations and transitions
- Dark mode support
- Responsive design

### 🎯 Intuitive UX

- Drag-and-drop field builder
- Live preview panel
- Visual field palette with icons
- Quick actions and keyboard shortcuts
- Field templates for common patterns

### ⚡ Powerful Features

- Real-time validation
- Advanced field configuration
- Section management
- Rule builder with natural language
- Export/import capabilities

## Architecture

### Component Structure

```
src/
├── components/
│   ├── builder/          # Main builder interface
│   │   ├── BuilderCanvas.tsx
│   │   ├── FieldPalette.tsx
│   │   └── LivePreview.tsx
│   ├── fields/           # Field components
│   │   ├── FieldCard.tsx
│   │   ├── FieldEditor.tsx
│   │   └── FieldTypeSelector.tsx
│   ├── sections/         # Section management
│   │   └── SectionManager.tsx
│   └── ui/              # Shared UI components (from ASC UI)
├── hooks/               # Custom React hooks
├── lib/                # Utilities and helpers
└── styles/             # Global styles
```

### Design Principles

1. **Progressive Disclosure**: Show simple options first, advanced features on demand
2. **Visual Feedback**: Clear indication of state changes, drag targets, validation
3. **Consistent Patterns**: Reuse UI patterns across the application
4. **Performance**: Smooth 60fps animations, optimized re-renders
5. **Accessibility**: Keyboard navigation, ARIA labels, screen reader support

## Improvements over V1

- ✨ Modern split-panel interface (builder + preview)
- 🎨 Visual field type selector with icons
- 🚀 Faster field configuration with inline editing
- 📱 Better responsive design
- ⌨️ Keyboard shortcuts for power users
- 🎭 Smooth animations and micro-interactions
- 🔄 Live preview updates
- 📋 Field templates and quick actions
- 🎯 Better drag-and-drop experience with visual feedback
